    ('a4fb7830-77c8-4022-af2a-2c7672f7d20b', 0, $$I am Timmy. This is my friend, Pepe, the puppy.$$),
    ('a4fb7830-77c8-4022-af2a-2c7672f7d20b', 1, $$I like to tease Pepe. I tell him I am better than him. He does not like it.$$),
    ('a4fb7830-77c8-4022-af2a-2c7672f7d20b', 2, $$“Look, I have a nose! ” I say. “Woof,” says Pepe. That means he has a nose too.$$),
    ('a4fb7830-77c8-4022-af2a-2c7672f7d20b', 3, $$“Look, I have ears! ” I say. “Woof,” says Pepe. That means he has ears too.$$),
    ('a4fb7830-77c8-4022-af2a-2c7672f7d20b', 4, $$“Look, I have eyes! ” I say. “Woof,” says Pepe. That means he has eyes too.$$),
    ('a4fb7830-77c8-4022-af2a-2c7672f7d20b', 5, $$“Look, I can dance on my legs! ” I say. “Woof, woof, woof,” says Pepe. That means he has legs.$$),
    ('a4fb7830-77c8-4022-af2a-2c7672f7d20b', 6, $$“Look, I have a tongue! ” I say. “Woof,” says Pepe. That means he has a tongue too.$$),
    ('a4fb7830-77c8-4022-af2a-2c7672f7d20b', 7, $$“I can think! ” I say. “Wooooooof,” says Pepe. That means he can think better.$$),
    ('a4fb7830-77c8-4022-af2a-2c7672f7d20b', 8, $$“Look I have hands! ” I say. “Grrrrrr…” Pepe says, and turns to show his little tail. That means he has a tail and I don’t have one.$$),
    ('a4fb7830-77c8-4022-af2a-2c7672f7d20b', 9, $$But I love Pepe, the puppy and he loves me too.$$),
    ('a4fb7830-77c8-4022-af2a-2c7672f7d20b', 10, $$In the picture above find: Eyes Hands Nose Legs Tongue Ears$$),
    ('a6372358-e984-4c17-8bdf-f1d7ff8db4a6', 0, $$For the very first time, Maaloo is collecting vegetables from the garden. He has collected red tomatoes, fresh brinjals and green lady's fingers.$$),
    ('a6372358-e984-4c17-8bdf-f1d7ff8db4a6', 1, $$Dadi says, “Well done, Maaloo! Go and get some potatoes too. ”$$),
    ('a6372358-e984-4c17-8bdf-f1d7ff8db4a6', 2, $$Maaloo looked at all the trees, creepers and plants. Not a single potato could he see.$$),
    ('a6372358-e984-4c17-8bdf-f1d7ff8db4a6', 3, $$“Dadi, the potatoes aren’t ready yet,” said Maaloo, putting the empty basket down. “No Maaloo, there are plenty of potatoes. Look carefully,” said Dadi.$$),
    ('a6372358-e984-4c17-8bdf-f1d7ff8db4a6', 4, $$Maaloo went into the garden once more. Kaaloo followed him. Maaloo was looking for potatoes when he heard, “Woof! Woof! ”$$),
    ('a6372358-e984-4c17-8bdf-f1d7ff8db4a6', 5, $$“Kaaloo! Stop, Kaaloo! ” yelled Maaloo, running behind him. “Don’t spoil the garden. ” Maaloo saw that Kaaloo was digging away and what do you think was coming out of the mud? Big fat potatoes!$$),
    ('a6372358-e984-4c17-8bdf-f1d7ff8db4a6', 6, $$“Well done, Kaaloo. You found the potatoes! ” laughed Maaloo, filling his basket with potatoes.$$),
